  "description": "2003-2006 Chevy Silverado Avalanche Headlight Assembly by YITAMOTOR. Light up the night and make your vehicle the envy of everyone who sees you with these astonishing headlights YITAMOTOR.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/2500/3500/1500 HD/2500 HD Pickup\n2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic Body Pickup Only\n2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nCompatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD, 2003-2004 Silverado 2500, 2003-2006 Silverado 2500 HD/3500, 2007 Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic, compatible with 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding); High beam bulb type: HB3/9005; Low beam bulb type: HB4/9006; Bulbs are not included; Professional installation would be highly recommended\nBrighter illumination: The metallic parabolic reflectors generate increased light output, producing a broader and more uniform beam distribution\nWaterproof: It is fully sealed with solid silicone and features one-way vent to prevent moisture trapping inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries, the headlights assembly maintains operational integrity in sorts of weather conditions\nImprove Safety: The sided micro-prism reflectors enhance nighttime visibility by reflecting headlights beams back toward their source, enabling rapid detection by oncoming vehicles or pedestrians and improving safety for both the driver and surrounding road users\nImpact Resistance: The polycarbonate lens and rugged housing exhibit impact and vibration resistance, enabling reliable performance under extreme road conditions",
